abstract: >-
  Pseudonymized observations from one real-provider round per ClassHero
  version and three simulated-provider passes. Includes offline reanalysis
  of audit completeness, monetary reconciliation, client outcomes and latency.
  Version 1.1.0 adds the integrated evaluation of version C against a simulated
  provider (simulator, harness scripts, synthetic run outputs and an offline
  recheck) and the recorded outcome of the deterministic property tests.
  This deposit does not include the private application; the real-round
  workload and the integrated runs cannot be re-executed without it.
keywords:
  - LLM observability
  - cost auditing
  - reproducible analysis
  - ClassHero
